=== shadow-MMU cost probe (all timing taken in-guest at EL1 via CNTVCT_EL0) ===
  payload 2864 bytes at IPA 0x40000000, RAM 320 MiB

=== 0. calibration (CNTVCT granularity, loop floor, clock estimate) ===
  CNTFRQ_EL0                                 24000000 Hz  (41.67 ns/tick)
  {isb; mrs cntvct_el0} back to back         9.14 ns
  empty {subs; b.ne} loop iteration          0.304 ns
  dependent ADD (1-cycle ALU latency)        0.3081 ns  -> clock ~ 3.25 GHz
  PMCCNTR_EL0 from guest EL1                 TRAPS TO EL2 (host exit) - unusable in-guest
  NOTE: every timed window below is bracketed by two {isb; mrs cntvct} pairs,
        so ~9 ns of read overhead is included once per ROUND, not per iteration.

=== 1. in-VM stage-1 fault round trip (EL1 fault -> our VBAR -> ERET) ===
  The permission-fault path is bimodal: it is cheap when the translation is already
  TLB/cache-resident and ~4x dearer when the walk data is cold or the page count
  exceeds the L1 dTLB. A translation fault always pays a full 4-level walk because
  VMSAv8-64 never caches an invalid descriptor. Both modes are reported.

  -- COLD: 64 pages, first config of the process
  loop iteration, no fault (control)              0.76 ns   [0.74 .. 0.80]  min 0.74        2.5 cyc
  loop iteration + translation fault             96.91 ns   [96.49 .. 97.48]  min 94.59      314.5 cyc
  loop iteration + permission fault             123.77 ns   [121.66 .. 125.32]  min 118.40      401.7 cyc
  => NET translation-fault round trip            96.16 ns 
                                                 312.1 cycles
  => NET permission-fault round trip            123.01 ns
                                                 399.2 cycles

  -- warm: 1 faulting page
  loop iteration, no fault (control)              0.78 ns   [0.75 .. 0.83]  min 0.74        2.5 cyc
  loop iteration + translation fault             63.54 ns   [60.62 .. 66.25]  min 59.61      206.2 cyc
  loop iteration + permission fault              29.15 ns   [27.65 .. 29.87]  min 27.41       94.6 cyc
  => NET translation-fault round trip            62.76 ns 
                                                 203.7 cycles
  => NET permission-fault round trip             28.37 ns
                                                  92.1 cycles

  -- warm: 64 faulting pages
  loop iteration, no fault (control)              0.81 ns   [0.77 .. 0.87]  min 0.77        2.6 cyc
  loop iteration + translation fault             95.21 ns   [94.07 .. 96.42]  min 93.94      309.0 cyc
  loop iteration + permission fault              29.00 ns   [28.65 .. 29.27]  min 28.17       94.1 cyc
  => NET translation-fault round trip            94.40 ns 
                                                 306.4 cycles
  => NET permission-fault round trip             28.20 ns
                                                  91.5 cycles

  -- warm: 512 faulting pages (> L1 dTLB)
  loop iteration, no fault (control)              0.78 ns   [0.76 .. 0.85]  min 0.75        2.5 cyc
  loop iteration + translation fault             94.88 ns   [94.04 .. 95.93]  min 93.88      307.9 cyc
  loop iteration + permission fault             103.62 ns   [102.67 .. 104.78]  min 101.59      336.3 cyc
  => NET translation-fault round trip            94.10 ns 
                                                 305.4 cycles
  => NET permission-fault round trip            102.84 ns
                                                 333.8 cycles

  -- warm: 64 pages, out-of-line handler
  loop iteration, no fault (control)              0.77 ns   [0.75 .. 0.79]  min 0.75        2.5 cyc
  loop iteration + translation fault             95.46 ns   [94.95 .. 96.38]  min 93.30      309.8 cyc
  loop iteration + permission fault              28.76 ns   [28.70 .. 28.82]  min 28.70       93.3 cyc
  => NET translation-fault round trip            94.70 ns 
                                                 307.3 cycles
  => NET permission-fault round trip             28.00 ns
                                                  90.9 cycles

  -- warm: 64 pages, inline handler again
  loop iteration, no fault (control)              0.76 ns   [0.75 .. 0.77]  min 0.75        2.5 cyc
  loop iteration + translation fault             94.69 ns   [93.92 .. 95.58]  min 93.16      307.3 cyc
  loop iteration + permission fault              29.16 ns   [28.94 .. 29.59]  min 28.90       94.6 cyc
  => NET translation-fault round trip            93.94 ns 
                                                 304.9 cycles
  => NET permission-fault round trip             28.40 ns
                                                  92.2 cycles

=== 2. full shadow-fill sequence (fault -> x86 walk -> descriptor -> [TLBI] -> ERET) ===

  -- handler ends with dsb ishst; TLBI VAAE1IS; dsb ish; isb
  faults taken: 12800 (expected 12800)

  FULL: touch + fault + fill + TLBI + ERET      439.94 ns   [416.42 .. 479.65]  min 368.65     1427.7 cyc
    component: bare touch loop, all mapped        0.73 ns   [0.65 .. 0.98]  min 0.65        2.4 cyc
    component: 4-level x86 walk only              1.14 ns   [1.14 .. 1.22]  min 1.14        3.7 cyc
    component: walk + xlate + descriptor store      5.13 ns   [5.05 .. 5.13]  min 5.05       16.6 cyc
    component: dsb+TLBI VAAE1IS+dsb+isb         260.99 ns   [257.65 .. 285.81]  min 253.01      847.0 cyc
  => NET cost per shadow-fill fault             439.21 ns   (1425 cycles)
       of which: walk+xlate+store                 5.13 ns  (1% of net)
       of which: TLBI + barriers                260.99 ns  (59% of net)

  -- handler ends with dsb ishst; isb  (no TLBI: the descriptor was INVALID, and VMSAv8-64 forbids caching invalid entries)
  faults taken: 12800 (expected 12800)

  FULL: touch + fault + fill + TLBI + ERET      146.89 ns   [141.93 .. 156.82]  min 141.93      476.7 cyc
    component: bare touch loop, all mapped        1.06 ns   [1.06 .. 1.14]  min 1.06        3.4 cyc
    component: 4-level x86 walk only              1.14 ns   [1.14 .. 1.30]  min 1.06        3.7 cyc
    component: walk + xlate + descriptor store      5.13 ns   [5.05 .. 5.13]  min 5.05       16.6 cyc
    component: dsb+TLBI VAAE1IS+dsb+isb         279.95 ns   [268.47 .. 336.18]  min 259.36      908.5 cyc
  => NET cost per shadow-fill fault             145.83 ns   (473 cycles)
       of which: walk+xlate+store                 5.13 ns  (4% of net)
       of which: TLBI + barriers                279.95 ns  (192% of net)

