=== 5. ASID switch vs ASID rollover (only 256 ASIDs, N-11) ===

  -- working set 256 pages (1024 KiB), 256 chased steps/round
  chase, warm, same ASID                          1.30 ns   [1.14 .. 1.46]  min 1.14        4.2 cyc
  TTBR0_EL1 ASID switch (msr+isb), each          10.34 ns   [10.25 .. 13.02]  min 10.25       33.5 cyc
  chase after switch away and back                1.14 ns   [0.98 .. 1.14]  min 0.98        3.7 cyc
  chase under a BRAND NEW ASID                   23.76 ns   [23.60 .. 23.93]  min 23.60       77.1 cyc
  chase right after TLBI VMALLE1IS               24.90 ns   [24.58 .. 25.23]  min 24.58       80.8 cyc
  => refill penalty of a fresh ASID              22.46 ns/page  ->     5.75 us for the whole working set
  => refill penalty after TLBI VMALLE1IS         23.60 ns/page  ->     6.04 us for the whole working set

  -- working set 1024 pages (4096 KiB), 1024 chased steps/round
  chase, warm, same ASID                          7.89 ns   [7.85 .. 7.89]  min 7.81       25.6 cyc
  TTBR0_EL1 ASID switch (msr+isb), each          10.27 ns   [10.25 .. 11.52]  min 10.25       33.3 cyc
  chase after switch away and back                7.89 ns   [7.89 .. 7.93]  min 7.85       25.6 cyc
  chase under a BRAND NEW ASID                   28.52 ns   [28.48 .. 29.91]  min 28.44       92.6 cyc
  chase right after TLBI VMALLE1IS               28.85 ns   [28.77 .. 29.74]  min 28.73       93.6 cyc
  => refill penalty of a fresh ASID              20.63 ns/page  ->    21.12 us for the whole working set
  => refill penalty after TLBI VMALLE1IS         20.96 ns/page  ->    21.46 us for the whole working set

  -- working set 3072 pages (12288 KiB), 3072 chased steps/round
  chase, warm, same ASID                          7.91 ns   [7.87 .. 8.65]  min 7.81       25.7 cyc
  TTBR0_EL1 ASID switch (msr+isb), each          10.29 ns   [10.27 .. 12.58]  min 10.26       33.4 cyc
  chase after switch away and back                7.92 ns   [7.91 .. 8.97]  min 7.88       25.7 cyc
  chase under a BRAND NEW ASID                   28.31 ns   [28.27 .. 30.83]  min 28.25       91.9 cyc
